==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Lynel Horns are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by all types of [[Lynel]]s upon their defeats. They're too hard for most blades to scratch, but they can be combined with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make White [[Dye]] or exchanged for [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]].

The [[Barbarian Set]] requires Lynel Horns to be upgraded to its first and second tiers at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
